### 1. Minta Ambilkan Semua Produk (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

###

### 2. Minta Ambilkan Produk ID 1 (GET by ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

###

### 3. Kirim Bungkusan Produk Baru (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Susu Gula Aren",
  "price": 18000.0,
  "stock": 35
}

###

### 4. Ubah Data Produk ID 1 (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika Premium (Diskon)",
  "price": 75000.0,
  "stock": 15
}

###

### 5. Minta Hapus Produk ID 2 (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/2

### 6. Uji Coba Satpam: Kirim Data Rusak (POST)
# Ekspektasi: Ditolak 400 Bad Request dengan rincian pesan error!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -50000.0,
  "stock": -10
}

### 7. Uji Coba Pagination: Minta Halaman 0, Ukuran 1 Barang per Halaman
# Ekspektasi: Hanya muncul 1 barang, tapi ada info totalPages dan totalElements
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?page=0&size=1

###

### 8. Uji Coba Sorting: Urutkan Produk dari yang TERMAHAL ke Termurah (price,desc)
# Ekspektasi: Kopi Gayo (85000) muncul duluan sebelum Teh Walini (25000)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?sort=price,desc